# Outfit camera (R18): a chunky instant camera in the accent colour, a glowing stripe across the face, a big steel lens
# standing proud, a signal-yellow flash (a thing the player uses), a dark print slot at the bottom front and a fresh
# print sticking out of the top.
name outfit_instantcam
grid 5
size 6 7 8
slot body SwatchAccent
slot stripe SwatchGlow
slot lens Steel
slot flash Signal
slot slot Ink
slot print Paint
box 0 0 0 4 7 6 body
paint box 3 0 4 4 7 5 stripe
beam 4 3.5 2.5 6 3.5 2.5 1.6 lens
carve beam 5.5 3.5 2.5 6 3.5 2.5 0.8
box 1 5 5 3 7 6 flash
paint box 3 1 0 4 6 1 slot
box 1 1 6 2 5 8 print
pivot 2 3 0
